  message: "Re-confirmed 2026-10-20 by the docstring audit (verifier repro): struct S { virtual void f() = 0; } -> struct S modifiers [], its method S::f ['public','virtual','abstract']; class C with the same member -> ['abstract']. cpp.py's docstring left stating the intent."  # 0360
